    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "If the airway is involved, securing it comes first. Unless the angioedema is clearly bradykinin-mediated (eg, ACE inhibitor, hereditary or acquired), give epinephrine IM or subcutaneously as for anaphylaxis. Bradykinin-mediated swelling may take more than 30 minutes to subside, so intubation is more likely"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Oropharyngeal or airway angioedema: subcutaneous epinephrine 0.3 mL of 1:1000 solution and hospital admission; on discharge, supply and teach an epinephrine autoinjector"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Severe mast cell–mediated reactions: always carry an autoinjector and oral antihistamines, self-treat quickly, then go to the emergency department"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Not shown to be effective in bradykinin-mediated angioedema (nor are glucocorticoids or antihistamines)"
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
